      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Pick Ankylosaur, Triceratops or Tyrannosaur when you cast. The Huge spirit appears within 90 ft, is an ally, shares your initiative (acting right after you) and obeys your commands; it Dodges if you give none. Its AC, Hit Points and attack damage grow with the slot level, its attacks use your spell attack bonus, and it makes attacks equal to half the spell's level. It disappears at 0 Hit Points or when your concentration ends.</p>",
